- Tightened [Disease.java](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/R011_module_java/Disease.java#L12) by making its fields `final`.
- Made [Simulator.java](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/R011_module_java/Simulator.java#L123) more declarative by extracting disease construction into a helper and using immutable map literals for the disease data.
- Cleaned up [FieldStats.java](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/R011_module_java/FieldStats.java#L11) by switching to `Map`, iterating over `values()`, and extracting `getOrCreateCounter(...)`.

